    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascend Factory</strong> is a factory simulation game that challenges your ingenuity and resource management skills. Dive into a world of automation and strategic planning as you build an ever-more efficient factory, floor by floor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>First Version Available!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first version of <strong>Ascend Factory</strong> is now playable! The game is still in development, and the <strong>1.0 release</strong> will bring many additions and improvements. Regular updates are planned to expand content and fix potential bugs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your factory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a factory using essential components:<br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Conveyors</strong>: Efficiently transport resources throughout your factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Splitters</strong>: Divide by separating resource flows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mergers</strong>: Combine resources logically on a Conveyor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Assemblers</strong>: Create new complex products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Foundries</strong>: Transform raw materials into usable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Elevators</strong>: Transport resources betweens layers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7f9fb63c1559ef615d2c3857dd418d22.poster.avif?t=1751388412\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7f9fb63c1559ef615d2c3857dd418d22.webm?t=1751388412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7f9fb63c1559ef615d2c3857dd418d22.mp4?t=1751388412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress Through Layers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new challenges at each layer. Complete levels by meeting specific resource requirements to unlock the next layer. Develop strategies and optimize your factory layout to solve increasingly complex puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elevate Your Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the use of the Elevator, your main block for vertically moving resources and transporting objects between different layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7986cc35d7fd59f83a3934782c747670.poster.avif?t=1751388412\" width=600 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7986cc35d7fd59f83a3934782c747670.webm?t=1751388412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7986cc35d7fd59f83a3934782c747670.mp4?t=1751388412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Unlockables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance in the game by meeting resource requirements and unlocking new layers. Discover new challenges at each stage as you progress through Ascend Factory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Future Under Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is ongoing, with <strong>new content updates</strong> and <strong>bug fixes</strong> on the way. Your feedback is crucial in shaping the ultimate <strong>Ascend Factory</strong> experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to build the ultimate automated tower?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascend Factory</strong> is a factory simulation game that challenges your ingenuity and resource management skills. Dive into a world of automation and strategic planning as you build an ever-more efficient factory, floor by floor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>First Version Available!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first version of <strong>Ascend Factory</strong> is now playable! The game is still in development, and the <strong>1.0 release</strong> will bring many additions and improvements. Regular updates are planned to expand content and fix potential bugs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your factory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a factory using essential components:<br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Conveyors</strong>: Efficiently transport resources throughout your factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Splitters</strong>: Divide by separating resource flows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mergers</strong>: Combine resources logically on a Conveyor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Assemblers</strong>: Create new complex products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Foundries</strong>: Transform raw materials into usable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Elevators</strong>: Transport resources betweens layers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7f9fb63c1559ef615d2c3857dd418d22.poster.avif?t=1751388412\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7f9fb63c1559ef615d2c3857dd418d22.webm?t=1751388412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour